  "worked_solution": "The speed is $12$ kilometers per second. To find the distance covered in $15$ seconds, we multiply the speed by $15.$ This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{distance} & =\\text{speed}\\cdot \\text{time} \\\\  & =12\\times 15 \\\\  & =180.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the spacecraft covered $180$ kilometers in $15$ seconds.",
